    ./lab down [alias]            destroy — refuses without a receipt
    ./lab down --all              destroy the whole fleet

  UPKEEP
    ./lab health                  the standing reproducibility audit
    ./lab exp list                every experiment module
    ./lab exp run <module>        run one, with the exact stored flags
    ./lab mirror                  push artifacts to Hugging Face
    ./lab docs                    rebuild every PDF, delete intermediates

